	(text_box "Composite Color Clocks\n\n6 color clocks for the composite output chroma signal are generated in different phases via these flip-flops. Note the inverted 14MHz clock used to generate Magenta and Green, which are a half cycle out of phase.\n\nColor clock generation is disabled if the BW mode bit is set."
